{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04587","headline":"五君咏五首 李赵公峤 · 张说","name":"五君咏五首 李赵公峤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李公实神敏，才华乃天授。\n睦亲何用心，处贵不忘旧。\n故事遵台阁，新诗冠宇宙。\n在人忠所奉，恶我诚将宥。\n南浦去莫归，嗟嗟蔑孙秀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}